===Investigate the crime scene{{subst:void|<!--202180201-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=companion|location=Black Swan's Memory Bubble|This dreamscape that Black Swan has prepared is way too exciting, throwing you into a "crime scene" As soon as you enter. Here you see Black Swan, a Bloodhound Family Law Enforcer, and... Sampo!? What is that guy doing here!?}}
{{Dialogue Start}}
:'''Black Swan:''' ...In my estimation, there's no question about it. This is murder.
:'''Bloodhound Family Member:''' Murder... Such a foreign word to us. The people of Penacony could never come to any harm while under the watchful protection of The Family.
:'''Bloodhound Family Member:''' In a dream, even if you're bashed a thousand times with a hammer, at worst you'll still wake up in reality in a hotel.
:'''Sampo:''' Not necessarily. Even if the result does not constitute harm, the criminal intent is... clear enough? You specifically came here to cordon off the scene because of the unsavory nature of this case, right?
:'''Bloodhound Family Member:''' You're not wrong. Even if there are no casualties, being smashed over the head with a hammer in the middle of the street for no reason at all... this is not the kind of thing that happens on Penacony.
:'''Bloodhound Family Member:''' You are guests of the Oak Family, so you may investigate the crime scene. I'll be on standby over here.
:'''Sampo:''' Are you a witch!? Just how did you manage to convince them in the blink of an eye that we're some kind of detectives...
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} (Tell the truth.)
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} (Offer no explanation.)
:'''Black Swan:''' Just some suggestions at the memory level. If something happens in everybody's memory... then that something becomes a fact.
